    "body": "## Problem\n\n`vim.lsp.enable()` errors with `Invalid buffer id` when a buffer is wiped after its config's `root_dir` calls back but before the client starts.\n\nFixes #42487\n\n## Solution\n\nSkip starting the client if the buffer is no longer valid, and log that it was skipped.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-20T16:52:43Z",
